{
  "file": "Latent",
  "page": 40,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        51.5809440612793,
        457.8085021972656,
        82.56494140625
      ],
      "text": "6.\t Preventive treatment for contacts",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.39409637451172,
        75.58094787597656,
        476.8619689941406,
        106.56494140625
      ],
      "text": "of patients with multidrug-resistant",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        113.39409637451172,
        99.58094787597656,
        242.36053466796875,
        130.56494140625
      ],
      "text": "tuberculosis",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 24.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        182.26649475097656,
        493.38653564453125,
        194.54049682617188
      ],
      "text": "In selected high-risk household contacts of patients with multidrug-resistant tuberculosis, preventive",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        194.2649688720703,
        501.8861083984375,
        206.53897094726562
      ],
      "text": "treatment may be considered based on individualised risk assessment and a sound clinical justification.",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        206.22543334960938,
        392.5163879394531,
        218.53744506835938
      ],
      "text": "New recommendation ) (Conditional recommendation, very low-quality evidence.",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        223.89541625976562,
        119.28404235839844,
        236.15992736816406
      ],
      "text": "Remarks",
      "font": "Whitney-SemiboldItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        241.60340881347656,
        496.0007629394531,
        253.87741088867188
      ],
      "text": "The preventive treatment should be individualized after a careful assessment of the intensity of exposure, the",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        253.6018829345703,
        505.4801025390625,
        265.8758850097656
      ],
      "text": "certainty of the source case, reliable information on the drug resistance pattern of the source case and potential",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        265.600341796875,
        143.20599365234375,
        277.8743591308594
      ],
      "text": "adverse events.",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        283.27032470703125,
        506.16778564453125,
        295.5443420410156
      ],
      "text": "The preventive treatment should be given only to household contacts at high risk (e.g. children, people receiving",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        295.268798828125,
        300.2391052246094,
        307.5428161621094
      ],
      "text": "immunosuppressive therapy and people living with HIV).",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        312.93878173828125,
        425.9583435058594,
        325.2127990722656
      ],
      "text": "The drugs should be selected according to the drug susceptibility profile of the source case.",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        330.6087951660156,
        282.31634521484375,
        342.8828125
      ],
      "text": "Confirmation of infection with LTBI tests is required.",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        348.27880859375,
        504.71234130859375,
        360.5528259277344
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation must not affect on-going placebo-controlled clinical trials of MDR-TB contacts on ethical",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        360.2773132324219,
        416.2541198730469,
        372.55133056640625
      ],
      "text": "grounds. The results of such clinical trials are crucial for updating this recommendation.",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        377.94732666015625,
        503.22564697265625,
        390.2213439941406
      ],
      "text": "Strict clinical observation and close monitoring for the development of active TB disease for at least 2 years are",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        389.9458312988281,
        314.74462890625,
        402.2198486328125
      ],
      "text": "required, regardless of the provision of preventive treatment.",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        431.6101989746094,
        174.2017364501953,
        447.11419677734375
      ],
      "text": "Summary of evidence",
      "font": "Whitney-MediumItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        450.4328308105469,
        526.6781616210938,
        463.2328186035156
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review of the effectiveness of preventive treatment for contacts of people with MDR-TB conducted",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        464.4328308105469,
        526.7091674804688,
        477.2328186035156
      ],
      "text": "for the 2015 LTBI guidelines  was updated. The updated review comprised 10 studies (6 newly identified   (9, 10)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        478.4328308105469,
        526.6583862304688,
        491.2328186035156
      ],
      "text": "and 4 from the previous review) that allowed comparisons between participants who received preventive",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        492.4328308105469,
        524.3831176757812,
        505.2328186035156
      ],
      "text": "treatment for MDR-TB and those who did not. Because of clinical heterogeneity among the studies, a meta-",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        506.432861328125,
        526.7122192382812,
        519.2328491210938
      ],
      "text": "analysis could not be performed. Of the 10 studies, one was excluded because only isoniazid monotherapy",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        520.432861328125,
        526.67138671875,
        533.2328491210938
      ],
      "text": "was used, and an additional five studies were excluded as fewer than 20 participants completed preventive",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        534.432861328125,
        526.6664428710938,
        547.2328491210938
      ],
      "text": "TB treatment. Therefore, the quality of the evidence was based on only four studies. The evidence-to-decision",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        236.037109375,
        548.3728637695312,
        305.6881408691406,
        561.3028564453125
      ],
      "text": "Annexes 1 and 2",
      "font": "Whitney-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86610412597656,
        548.432861328125,
        308.2861328125,
        561.2328491210938
      ],
      "text": "and the GRADE tables are presented in  .",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        568.1028442382812,
        526.6561279296875,
        580.90283203125
      ],
      "text": "No TB case was reported in either the intervention or the control group in one study  , while one case of  (64)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        582.1028442382812,
        526.6712036132812,
        594.90283203125
      ],
      "text": "active TB due to a drug-susceptible strain that was different from that of the source case was reported in",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86611938476562,
        596.1028442382812,
        526.6820678710938,
        608.90283203125
      ],
      "text": "another study  . The remaining two studies   addressed the efficacy of preventive treatment. In  (65) (66, 67)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86613464355469,
        610.1028442382812,
        526.654296875,
        622.90283203125
      ],
      "text": "one study of 119 cohorts, 104 contacts with LTBI initiated fluoroquinolone-based preventive treatment, of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86613464355469,
        624.1028442382812,
        526.6333618164062,
        636.90283203125
      ],
      "text": "whom 93 (89%) completed treatment, and none developed active TB; while 3 of 15 (20%) contacts who",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86613464355469,
        638.1028442382812,
        526.6620483398438,
        650.90283203125
      ],
      "text": "refused treatment developed MDR-TB (odds ratio, 0.02, 95% CI 0.00;0.39)  . In the other study, confirmed  (66)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85614013671875,
        652.1028442382812,
        526.57421875,
        664.90283203125
      ],
      "text": "or probable TB developed in 2 of 41 (4.9%) children receiving tailored preventive treatment and in 13 of 64",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85614013671875,
        666.1028442382812,
        519.6361694335938,
        678.90283203125
      ],
      "text": "(20.3%) children who did not receive proper preventive treatment (odds ratio, 0.2, 95% CI 0.04;0.94)  .  (67)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85617065429688,
        685.7728271484375,
        526.6263427734375,
        698.5728149414062
      ],
      "text": "The drugs used in these studies were mainly fluoroquinolones (e.g. moxifloxacin, levofloxacin) with or without",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85617065429688,
        699.7728271484375,
        526.708251953125,
        712.5728149414062
      ],
      "text": "other agents (e.g. ethambutol, ethionamide). None of studies included a comparison of the risk for adverse",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85617065429688,
        713.7728271484375,
        526.6993408203125,
        726.5728149414062
      ],
      "text": "events, although one reported that no serious adverse events could be attributed to fluoroquinolone-based",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85617065429688,
        727.7728271484375,
        526.6452026367188,
        740.5728149414062
      ],
      "text": "preventive treatment  . The median proportion of participants who discontinued treatment because of  (66)",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.85617065429688,
        741.7728271484375,
        381.3232421875,
        754.5728149414062
      ],
      "text": "adverse events in all the studies was 5.1% (interquartile range, 1.9–30.2%).",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.3202018737793,
        790.2608032226562,
        56.69620132446289,
        810.61279296875
      ],
      "text": "28",
      "font": "Whitney-Light",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        796.524658203125,
        458.3740539550781,
        805.5686645507812
      ],
      "text": "LATENT TUBERCULOSIS INFECTION: UPDATED AND CONSOLIDATED GUIDELINES FOR PROGRAMMATIC MANAGEMENT",
      "font": "Whitney-Medium",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}